<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent criminal activity in Ecuador has intensified with a gang highway robbery of soybeans, a high-value heist, and the murder of two local election candidates in El Oro. Journalist Tomás Beltrán Conforme was shot dead outside his home despite protective measures, and a police officer was killed while three colleagues were abducted after a checkpost attack in Pakistan's Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, showing the reach of related violence. These events follow ongoing prison gang fights and U.S. anti-cartel operations, but now include high-profile heists and targeted killings of political and media figures. There were 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE1oRXRQUF95bHFfeW1jM1E2dDhOMnMwWWRuRGxVMGp3dElscUxDTGR3aENpNEFOOHFWWGFiQm5PT1BDSko5Smk3SFE1NVN4a3hnMTZXdU9zQzZ4ZHEwak5XYXFIcXhXWFVsVExPWHJERDZNQlNZMHBqcmlIZUg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQSEFYX0VWdWVmRU1sTkxBZ3Z1ZUFsa3VOSFMtSXE4T2ZMWGVDRW1JS0dhNjk4ZTFnQTZVc3VXLWhnai1JSFhhRG05amxyMFMxVkFoZUFyRDNQTnpEYnNzSGdiZkhTYTRZQVAxU0VhMXVvZGhObU42MFR5bExSYkRKQVU2NDRoazVzOWdMNVVxekZKX3VvdHlpalV0Yw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Journalism Pakistan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxPZE1xckt6SGdyMlJGOEF2MnlnanlmYjlmS3BHb1dQaXA5cmlwUGliXzJHai1MZ0hJTW1IejRWMWxVUmJIb0QzWFIwRVhRUzUwSWxGZUdoSklRY0ZJVHFzUVR3QlVVYWNYMG10UXpYbFhMcnJBT1VMRS15X3A1b0FkTUduVUprdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Newsner&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPRHR3TFVieDBkRGxBVWd3S0xNejlPWTZNZkJYTjdCM25PWEtOZndTRF9IQVJaTVNOTV83OWlhc3g1VjNLRF9iNllqd1VMUzZ0cHVtZmpMMk1vamJ4Zk1kdHlDclROOWdIc3hxWDNhQW5pbi1lZnBKT0FIbks4eWJkZFV2UWdBaUNJ?oc